				<r3d:description language="eng">This catalogue implements the Gaia Blu Cruise Inventory, which is the comprehensive catalogue of research objects generated during Gaia Blu cruises. It contributes to making Gaia Blu data FAIR (Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, and Reusable). Gaia Blu is the primary research vessel of the National Research Council of Italy. It is equipped with advanced instruments and technologies that support extensive research in geology, oceanography, biology, and atmospheric sciences across the Mediterranean Sea and other oceanic regions, including polar areas.

All the products are accompanied with rich descriptions capturing general attributes, e.g. title and creator(s), as well as usage policies and licences.</r3d:description>
